{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2028","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Alice's Adventures in \"Chess\""}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Alice is trying to meet up with the Red Queen in the countryside! Right now, Alice is at position $$$(0, 0)$$$, and the Red Queen is at position $$$(a, b)$$$. Alice can only move in the four cardinal directions (north, east, south, west). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"More formally, if Alice is at the point $$$(x, y)$$$, she will do one of the following: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" go north (represented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"N"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), moving to $$$(x, y+1)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" go east (represented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), moving to $$$(x+1, y)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" go south (represented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"S"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), moving to $$$(x, y-1)$$$; or "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" go west (represented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), moving to $$$(x-1, y)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Alice's movements are predetermined. She has a string $$$s$$$ representing a sequence of moves that she performs from left to right. Once she reaches the end of the sequence, she repeats the same pattern of moves forever."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Can you help Alice figure out if she will ever meet the Red Queen?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 500$$$). The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$ ($$$1 \\le n$$$, $$$a$$$, $$$b \\le 10$$$) — the length of the string and the initial coordinates of the Red Queen."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ consisting only of the characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"N"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"S"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes) denoting whether Alice will eventually meet the Red Queen."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (upper or lower). For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as positive responses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n2 2 2\nNE\n3 2 2\nNNE\n6 2 1\nNNEESW\n6 10 10\nNNEESW\n3 4 2\nNEE\n4 5 5\nNEWS\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, Alice follows the path $$$(0,0) \\xrightarrow[\\texttt{N}]{} (0,1) \\xrightarrow[\\texttt{E}]{} (1,1) \\xrightarrow[\\texttt{N}]{} (1,2) \\xrightarrow[\\texttt{E}]{} (2,2)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, Alice can never reach the Red Queen."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"2028A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2028/problem/A"}